/P 110 0 R
/E (Current satellite fire-monitoring systems such as NASA FIRMS detect thermal anomalies but cannot reliably distinguish industrial fires and persistent thermal sources from forest, agricultural and other fires. Our system addresses this gap by combining thermal, geographic and land-cover intelligence with AI-based classification.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
